# Admin 필터 영역 (어댑터)

**치수·금지:** 공유 SSOT → [filter-area-dimensions.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/cms-admin-ui/filter-area-dimensions.mdc)  
**URL 동기화:** [list-filter-url-sync.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/cms-admin-ui/list-filter-url-sync.mdc)

## Admin path

| 항목 | 경로 |
|------|------|
| 토큰 CSS | `apps/admin/src/shared/ui/filter-controls-common.css` |
| 레이아웃 | `apps/admin/src/shared/ui/admin-filter-area.css` · `admin-filter-area` |
| 상수 | `apps/admin/src/shared/constants/filter-field-width.ts` |

## 마크업 (1행)

```tsx
<div className="admin-filter-area">
  <div className="admin-filter-area__field admin-filter-area__field--control">
    <p className="admin-filter-area__label">…</p>
    <CmsSelect inputSize="large" width={FILTER_CONTROL_MAX_WIDTH_PX} … />
  </div>
  <div className="admin-filter-area__field admin-filter-area__field--date-range">
    <p className="admin-filter-area__label">게시 기간</p>
    <CmsDateRangePicker inputSize="large" width={FILTER_CONTROL_WIDE_FIELD_WIDTH_PX} … />
  </div>
  <div className="admin-filter-area__actions">
    <CmsButton className="admin-filter-area__search-button" size="large" width={FILTER_SEARCH_BUTTON_WIDTH_PX}>
      조회
    </CmsButton>
  </div>
</div>
```

## 2행 (CMS `mergedAutoFillTrailingFieldKeys` 미러)

시안처럼 **1행 필드 / 2행 trailing + 조회**가 필요할 때 (예: 공지 — 작성일·조회 하단).

CMS: `multiRowResponsiveLayout="merged-auto-fill"` + `mergedAutoFillTrailingFieldKeys`  
→ Admin:

```tsx
<div className="admin-filter-area admin-filter-area--split">
  <div className="admin-filter-area__head">
    {/* 상단 필드들 — flex-wrap, 240/500 고정 */}
  </div>
  <div className="admin-filter-area__bottom">
    <div className="admin-filter-area__bottom-fields">
      {/* trailing 필드 (예: 작성일 dateRange) */}
    </div>
    <div className="admin-filter-area__actions">…조회…</div>
  </div>
</div>
```

- 행 간 gap = `--filter-field-gap` (12px)
- 조회는 하단 행 `margin-left: auto` (우측)
- 필드 폭 stretch(`flex: 1` · `%`) 금지 — 공유 치수 SSOT

